WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.890
Mom: Rachel. What day is it today?

2
00:00:03.891 --> 00:00:06.877
Rachel: It’s December 31st.

3
00:00:06.878 --> 00:00:11.999
Mom: That’s right. What day is tomorrow?

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.667
Rachel: It’s the first day of the new

5
00:00:15.668 --> 00:00:21.068
year. Mom: That’s correct. It will be the year

6
00:00:21.069 --> 00:00:24.345
2006. What do you want to do in the new year?

7
00:00:24.346 --> 00:00:32.800
Ricky: I want to fly.

8
00:00:32.801 --> 00:00:37.810
Rachel: Hee-hee! Ricky, flying is impossible.

9
00:00:37.811 --> 00:00:39.599
Mom: Okay, Rachel.

10
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.666
What do you want to do in the new year?

11
00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:46.297
Rachel: I’ll be good to my brother.

12
00:00:46.298 --> 00:00:50.610
Ricky: Thanks, sis!

13
00:00:50.611 --> 00:00:54.692
Father: Come on, everyone. It’s almost time.

14
00:00:54.693 --> 00:00:59.550
Ricky: Wow! What are they doing?

15
00:00:59.551 --> 00:01:03.939
Father: They are counting down to the new year.

16
00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:10.001
TV Announcer: 10, 9, 8, 7, 6 . .

17
00:01:10.002 --> 00:01:17.335
. Everyone: . . . 5, 4, 3, 2, 1. Happy New

18
00:01:17.336 --> 00:01:23.629
Year! Happy New Year, everyone!

